invariant: INV-22
file: handshake.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: the blocking driver decides whether a Certificate comes next from
  cfg.psk, which says what the hello offered, instead of
  ch_tls.psk_selected, which says what the ServerHello chose. After a
  declined ticket it skips the certificate step and refuses the server's
  Certificate at the Finished step, and the declined-ticket rows object.

--- old
    if (!t->psk_selected) {
        rc = hsa_server_auth(h);
--- new
    if (t->cfg.psk == NULL) {
        rc = hsa_server_auth(h);
